  "details": "This was discovered during a vrcfury support request.\n\nIf a parameter is available within one of the avatar's animator controllers, and that parameter has an invalid type (for instance, -1, rather than AnimatorControllerParameterType.Bool, Float, Int, or Trigger), then an exception will be logged to the vrchat output log on every frame (attached), and every parameter below that one in the list will not properly copy to the mirror clone.",
